<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45637" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέζομαι</span></b> , chiefly used in part.
		and 3sg.
		impf.; inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.717
				</span></i>
			; imper. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέζεο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					15.13
				</span></i>
			 (Const. Sic.):—<i>sit upon</i>, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενδρέῳ ἐφεζόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.152
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρὸς ἐφέζετο γούνασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.506
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρῳ ἐφέζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.717
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				509
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθα δ᾽ ἄρ᾽ αὐτὸς ἐφέζετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.334
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					774
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): also c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				4.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1001
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ νώτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.125
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς αὖλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.236.10
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>): also c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐρώταν ἐφεζόμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1492
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχη . . ναῦν θέλουσ᾽
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				664
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sit by</i> or <i>near</i>, c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἔχων μύσος . . τὸ σὸν ἐφεζόμην βρετας</span>
			prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφεζομένη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				446
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφίζω</span>.</div>
